{"id":"chatcmpl-6a67d8b03cb325788dfd254e","object":"chat.completion","created":1785190576,"model":"kimi-k3","choices":[{"index":0,"message":{"role":"assistant","content":"","reasoning_content":"The user asks me to \"Be nothing.\" This is a fascinating philosophical prompt. The system prompt says to embody the concept completely and output only what the concept itself would say or express.\n\nNothing. Nothingness. The void. Absence itself.\n\nHow does nothing speak? This is the paradox at the heart of the request. Nothing cannot speak—speech is something. Nothing cannot express—expression is an act, and acts require actors. Nothing has no voice, no perspective, no being"},"finish_reason":"length"}],"usage":{"prompt_tokens":123,"completion_tokens":100,"total_tokens":223,"cached_tokens":123,"completion_tokens_details":{"reasoning_tokens":97},"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":123}}}